/// reviewed adapter): the companion envelope pins (117/132/72 bytes) are dated
/// prototype-ABI measurements with no live surface, and old sizes must not freeze.
/// Protects: envelope bytes are deterministic and measured; operations
/// protocol/packaging; pinned byte/count observation.
/// Variants: all values/host faults enumerated in this declaration.
/// Environment: Bun prototype test environment (no live run; relevance decision needs no live qualification).
